SUMMARY:Randomonium’s 80’s Neon Halloween Eve Party at Mills River Bre
 wery
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\n**Hey y’all!! Come on out to Mills Ri
 ver Brewery to celebrate Halloween a day early for a fun night of live 80
 ’s music from the great band Randomonium! The theme for this party is 80
 ’s neon\, but come dressed in the costume of your choice**\n\n**There is
  a costume contest with prizes awarded**\n\n**Please note there is a cover
  charge for this event. See details below**\n\n**Doors open at 6:00 PM\, S
 how at 7:00PM.**\n**$15 Cover for general admission. $10 Early bird ticket
 s available until 10/25.**\n\n**$75 Couples VIP: includes 2 cover charges\
 , 2 drink tickets\, a table near the stage\, table service for the evening
  and some fun treats!**\n\n**Get your tickets now!**\n\n**www.eventbrite.c
 om/e/randomoniums-80s-halloween-party-at-mills-river-brewing-co-tickets-20
 02637819628**\n\n**https://www.millsriverbrewingco.com/events/80s-neon-par
 ty-with-randomonium**
